  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Fire Bolt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" title=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">1124750\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Shoots a bolt of fire at your enemies.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Fire Bolt</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive skill</a> that shoots fire at enemies. It is a starting skill for <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Mage\" title=\"Mage\">Mages</a>. It also has a longer range than other Bolt spells.\n</p><p>Fire Bolt is listed in the following build(s):\n<i><a href=\"/wiki/Healthy_Obsidian_Mage\" title=\"Healthy Obsidian Mage\">Healthy Obsidian Mage</a></i>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Shoots a bolt of fire at your enemies, causing X fire damage.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin: 1em 0.25em; border: 1px solid #6A3; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"bor